### When would I lean the other way?

I would lean toward antiviral treatment if you tell me that she has one or more of:

- significant confirmed asthma, particularly poorly controlled;
- obesity;
- pregnancy;
- immunosuppression;
- significant heart/lung/kidney disease;
- diabetes;
- unvaccinated/no prior immunity;
- clearly deteriorating respiratory COVID.

Then I would take treatment more seriously.

